                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <p class="cookieNote">You can control cookies through your browser settings. However, disabling cookies may affect website functionality.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div id="rights" class="privacySection">
                            <h3>✨ Your Rights & Choices</h3>
                            <p>Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your personal information:</p>
                            <div class="rightsGrid">
                                <div class="rightItem">
                                    <span class="rightIcon">👁️</span>
                                    <div>
                                        <strong>Right to Access</strong>
